{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016550/extras/ceefb04b13464bd193b7fa600fff1221.avif?t=1758641553\" data-has-big width=1560 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25\u3010Designed for True Lazy Adventurers\u3011\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of repetitive monster hunting? Had enough of all-night grinding? Reject bottomless spending? Then this game is made for you! No frantic screen tapping, no memorizing complicated combos\u2014all you need to do is effortlessly choose skills, equip gear, set adventure strategies\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016550/extras/9e2f9c6a806693ca2c06bf7aec27ec4f.avif?t=1758641553\" data-has-big width=1560 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf\u3010One-Man Army, Focus on Progression\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated party management, no class dilemmas\u2014just focus on a single character, from zero to legendary hero. Every level up, every piece of equipment, every skill breakthrough lets you feel the joy of &quot;progression&quot; firsthand!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016550/extras/b86432ae5cc33341ad8bb5903cc1aebb.avif?t=1758641553\" data-has-big width=1560 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\u3010Hundreds of Strategies, Freedom to Mix and Match\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of skills \u00d7 Ever-changing gear attributes = Endless fun in experimentation! Stack extreme damage? Build a tanky reflect build? Summoner playstyle? Control master? There\u2019s no one right answer\u2014only your unique strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016550/extras/c61ed24162b2c34b96e9c6ed8495aa39.avif?t=1758641553\" data-has-big width=1560 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4b\u3010One-Handed Gameplay, Perfect for Slacking Off\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During work or class? No problem. Eating while binge-watching? Still manageable! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4d Wishlist the game now and embark on a relaxed yet deep adventure anytime!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Ultra-convenient, strategy-focused, achievement-packed\u2014everything is in your control!  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016550?t=1758641553","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016550?t=1758641553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016550/587da266eaf8a1aa07159c7dab435cf6382d70ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758641553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016550/587da266eaf8a1aa07159c7dab435cf6382d70ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758641553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016550/extras/ceefb04b13464bd193b7fa600fff1221.avif?t=1758641553\" data-has-big width=1560 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25\u3010Designed for True Lazy Adventurers\u3011\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of